0.100 0.150 0.250 rg
BT /F3 6.4 Tf 42.0 647.6 Td (Ans: +40 pts for identical pickup \(+20 if nearby <=6km\); +40 pts for identical dropoff \(+20 if nearby <=6km\).) Tj ET
